{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02617","headline":"赠李徵君大寿 · 王绩","name":"赠李徵君大寿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孔淳辞散骑，陆昶谢中郎。\n幅巾朝帝罢，杖策去官忙。\n附车还赵郡，乘船向武昌。\n九徵书未已，十辟誉弥彰。\n副君迎绮季，天子送严光。\n灞陵幽径近，磻谿隐路长。\n编蓬还作室，绩草更爲裳。\n会稽置樵处，兰陵卖药行。\n看书惟道德，开教止农桑。\n别有幽怀侣，由来高让王。\n前年辞厚币，今岁返寒乡。\n有书横石架，无毡坐土牀。\n兰英犹足酿，竹实本无粮。\n涧松寒转直，山菊秋自香。\n管宁存祭礼，王霸重朝章。\n去去相随去，披裘骄盛唐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02617.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02617","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}